            "typeName": "dataSources",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "Primarily preporatory vocational (vmbo) secondary school students from the province South Holland (sample wave 1: 1978). Data collection took place at 12 secondary schools in South Holland. The surveys were completed by the students themselves on a computer. Two research assistents were present during this datacollection. Students were provided with a roster / name list of the fellow students from the same grade and had to fill in the number of those who they associate with."
            ]
